    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Printed in Great Brilain\nBuckingham Palace from St. James's Park, London.\nMENU\nALL OVER THE WORLO B-O-A•C TAKES 5000 GARE OF YOU",
      "NORTH ATLANTIC SERVICE\nWELCOME ABOARD THIS B.O. A.C. FLIGHT\nIt is our wish to attend to your\ncomfort and needs at all times\nduring this Flight.\nPlease ring for the Steward\nfor anything that you may require\nCanapé Lucullus\nPoussin Poele Provencal\nButtered Brussels Sprouts\nParmentier Potatoes\nFruit Cream Gâteau\nCoffee\nREFRESHMENTS\nAssorted Sandwiches\nFruited Madeira Cake\nBeverages\nBAR SERVICE AND CIGARETTES\nWhisky - Gin - Martini Sweet or Dry\nBrandy V.S.O.P. - Liqueurs\nSelected French Wines from\nBurgundy and Bordeaux, ‡ Bottles\nChampagne ‡ Bottles\nSherry - Vermouth\nEnglish Beer - Lager\nPackets of 20's English or American\nPackets of 25's English\nPlease see Information\nFolder for prices\n25 201262\n2007.002.008"
    ],
